# NEAR MISS: overtake a walker 0.8 m to their side at 6 m/s. They only notice you as you come
# alongside (they step away, too late to matter); you pass 0.93 m off them: NEAR MISS, banked on its
# own like a gap.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 ped at -65.5 -270 356
cmd 1 teleport -64.89 -282 2.48 355.66
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x -0.4536
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 5.983
run 400
expect event nearMiss{points=250,distance=0.93} within 358..362
expect event comboLanded{name=NEAR MISS,points=250} within 370..374
expect skater.score == 250 at 400
expect no event pedHit
expect no event bail
